          "text": "The ball launches from the floor and follows a high arc, but descends too soon: it is already below the rim when it reaches the hoop. It lands on the floor rather than dropping through the basket.\n\nThe correction removes aerodynamic forces and uses a ballistic launch calculated to cross the rim center after 1.60 s, moving downward.\n\n```xml\n<mujoco model=\"basketball_hoop\">\n  <option timestep=\"0.002\" gravity=\"0 0 -9.81\" density=\"0\" viscosity=\"0\" integrator=\"RK4\"/>\n\n  <visual>\n    <headlight ambient=\"0.15 0.15 0.15\" diffuse=\"0.3 0.3 0.3\" specular=\"0 0 0\"/>\n  </visual>\n\n  <worldbody>\n    <light name=\"overhead_sun\" directional=\"true\" pos=\"2 0 10\" dir=\"0 0 -1\" diffuse=\"0.8 0.8 0.8\" specular=\"0.2 0.2 0.2\" castshadow=\"true\"/>\n    <light name=\"overhead_fill\" pos=\"4 0 8\" dir=\"0 0 -1\" diffuse=\"0.3 0.3 0.3\" specular=\"0 0 0\" castshadow=\"false\"/>\n\n    <geom name=\"floor\" type=\"plane\" pos=\"0 0 0\" size=\"10 10 0.1\" rgba=\"0.72 0.52 0.32 1\" friction=\"0.8 0.005 0.0001\"/>\n\n    <!-- Regulation basketball, initially touching the floor. -->\n    <body name=\"ball\" pos=\"0 0 0.1194\">\n      <freejoint name=\"ball_free\"/>\n      <inertial pos=\"0 0 0\" mass=\"0.62\" diaginertia=\"0.005893 0.005893 0.005893\"/>\n      <geom name=\"ball\" type=\"sphere\" size=\"0.1194\" rgba=\"0.85 0.40 0.10 1\" friction=\"0.9 0.01 0.001\" solref=\"0.01 0.2\"/>\n    </body>\n\n    <!-- Fixed hoop, centered 4 m away and 3.05 m above the floor. -->\n    <body name=\"hoop\" pos=\"4 0 3.05\">\n      <geom name=\"rim_00\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"0.2366 0 0 0.2186 0.0905 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_01\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"0.2186 0.0905 0 0.1673 0.1673 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_02\" type=\"capsule\" size=\"0.008\" fromto=\"0.1673 0.1673 0 0.0905 0.2186 0\" rgba=\"0.9 0.3 0.05 1\"/>\n      <geom name=\"rim_03\" type=\"capsule\" size=